{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e16-scene-07",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "不能架空淳于总  (Refusing to Let Chun Yuqiao Be Sidelined)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "xingzi": "杏子"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In Xingtian's conference room, Kaiwen and Xingzi urge caution after a featured guest's brother vanishes overseas, Qin Xiao relays a cool message from DTS, and rival executives try to sideline Chun Yuqiao while he is ill. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经失踪二十四小时，肯定出事了，这有什么不确定的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这可是咱们节目里非常重要、多次出现的一个人物，现在恐袭里生死不明了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你说这叫什么话呀你，咱们不能不顾他的感受吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "反正既然我们淳总有意见，这事就不能掉以轻心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不好意思，来晚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任有事要和领导汇报，这个会来不了，我来做笔录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任留了一句话，他说合作是看中团队，而不是某一个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这还怎么聊啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "什么意思？你这是架空他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是想累死他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们总编室，你说，你们说！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经失踪二十四小时，肯定出事了，这有什么不确定的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has been missing for twenty-four hours—something definitely happened, so what is uncertain about that?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这可是咱们节目里非常重要、多次出现的一个人物，现在恐袭里生死不明了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is a vital figure who appears repeatedly in our show, and right now nobody knows if he survived the attack.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你说这叫什么话呀你，咱们不能不顾他的感受吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How can you talk like that—we cannot simply ignore our guest's feelings, can we?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "反正既然我们淳总有意见，这事就不能掉以轻心。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In any case, since Mr Chun Yuqiao raised concerns, we cannot take this matter lightly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不好意思，来晚了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me for arriving late.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任有事要和领导汇报，这个会来不了，我来做笔录。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My director had to brief senior leadership and could not attend this meeting, so I am here to take notes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任留了一句话，他说合作是看中团队，而不是某一个人。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The director left one message: our partnership values the whole team rather than any single individual.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这还怎么聊啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How are we even supposed to continue this discussion?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "什么意思？你这是架空他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean by that? You are stripping him of his authority!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是想累死他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are trying to work him to exhaustion!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们总编室，你说，你们说！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Speak up—when has our chief editor's office ever let the company down?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "已经失踪二十四小时，肯定出事了，这有什么不确定的？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这可是咱们节目里非常重要、多次出现的一个人物，现在恐袭里生死不明了。",
      "gap": 0.5
