    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不好意思，来晚了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任有事要和领导汇报，这个会来不了，我来做笔录。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "主任留了一句话，他说合作是看中团队，而不是某一个人。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这还怎么聊啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "什么意思？你这是架空他！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这是想累死他！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "我们总编室，你说，你们说！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Outraged that company leadership quietly allowed Chun Yuqiao to be pushed aside, Xingzi and Kaiwen make a bold decision together. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
